        "The cutoff frequency was estimated as ω c =27.61± From the fitting curve in Fig. 4, we obtained the response function R′ (ω) = ω 2 /(ω 2 + ω 2 c )γ. We compared this response function R′ (ω) and correlation functions of the velocity C(ω) obtained from the trajectories of the particle. In Fig. 5, we found a good coincidence between C(ω) and 2k B T R′ (ω) in the equilibrium state. Thus, the fluctuation dissipation relation was confirmed."
